 an unconfirmed CD polarity). GEOMETRY from the LCSC/EasyEDA C381071 verified land pattern (easyeda2kicad --full): 7 small SMD contact pads (VCC/RST/CLK/CD/GND/VPP/IO, 0.6-0.8x1.3mm at y=-6.74) + 4 large SMD shell tabs (1.0x2.1mm at the four corners, all renumbered pad 8 to merge onto one symbol pin, matching this project's MHF4 GND-tab convention) + 2 unnamed 0.9mm NPTH mounting pegs (no signal, listed in check_footprints.py REVERSE_ALLOWLIST). CD polarity CONFIRMED from XKB's own drawing (Dwg No. XKNANO-113, LCSC datasheet mirror): CD switch to GND reads NORMAL=SHORT / CARD INSERTED=OPEN -- matches this project's \"grounded=absent\" DET convention (verification.md Item 7) exactly, closing the open CD-polarity order gate from docs/sourcing.md Sec.5 Note 3 with a documented answer.") (tags "SIM nanoSIM UICC push-push connector XKB XKNANO-113") (property "Reference" "J203" (at 0 -9.2 0) (layer "F.Fab") (uuid "bdc084b4-efb8-5769-a6fa-7c537c6fc964") (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7) (thickness 0.1)))) (property "Value" "XKNANO-113" (at 0 9.2 0) (layer "F.Fab") (uuid "0ac55059-ecaa-5ef9-abf3-34f6dc1745a6") (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.15))) (hide yes)) (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start 6.58 -3.99) (end 6.58 5.41) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "b709ec83-863c-581d-a9e2-970e2bdc04c4")) (fp_line (start -6.5 8.08) (end 6.58 8.08) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "c40b2269-0144-57e5-bf8b-b4735ae10711")) (fp_line (start -6.5 -3.99) (end -6.5 5.41) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "8301443e-b236-5227-9e78-ed8f75ad761b")) (fp_line (start 3.15 -6.78) (end 6.58 -6.78) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "6aee85bc-280d-59ba-b2a0-cf5fc5f31ea3")) (fp_line (start 6.58 -6.78) (end 6.58 -6.53) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "e958c12c-bd53-5024-83df-0691b00dfa4f")) (fp_line (start -6.5 -6.78) (end -6.5 -6.53) (stroke (wi